:''For other uses, see [[Kaoru (disambiguation)]].''
'''Li'l Kaoru''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 750
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Li'l Kaoru
|name2 = Li'l Kaoru CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Kaoru CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Much like [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]], she tries to be an anti-Floating Crowd-Controller, but fails at it due to being outclassed by [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]. While her recharge time isn't quite as pathetic as Boshisattva's, it is still much longer than Sanzo's 4 second recharge.

While she isn't of much use as a Crowd-Controller, it is worth noting that she does have surprisingly good stats, which can actually rival a non-[[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. While there still are better options for midranged damaging units, she may see some occasional use thanks to said stats.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

